  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Inspecting Tailwind Setup**\n\nI\'m currently verifying the Tailwind configuration within `src/index.css`. Specifically, I\'m checking the `@import \"tailwindcss\";` directive in relation to the latest Tailwind 4 updates. My next step is to ensure proper configuration of font families and custom keyframe animations. I\'ve begun reviewing the font families, starting with `Outfit` for display and `Plus Jakarta Sans` for the body.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_5191646"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false,\"CodeContent\":\"@import \\\"tailwindcss\\\";\\n\\n@layer base {\\n  :root {\\n    --font-display: \'Outfit\', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;\\n    --font-body: \'Plus Jakarta Sans\', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;\\n    --font-mono: \'JetBrains Mono\', monospace;\\n  }\\n\\n  body {\\n    font-family: var(--font-body);\\n    color: #e2e8f0;\\n    background-color: #090d16;\\n    overflow-x: hidden;\\n  }\\n\\n  h1, h2, h3, h4, .font-display {\\n    font-family: var(--font-display);\\n  }\\n\\n  .font-mono, code, pre, .tabular-nums {\\n    font-family: var(--font-mono);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/* Subtle custom scrollbar */\\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\\n  width: 6px;\\n  height: 6px;\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\\n  background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\\n  background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);\\n  border-radius: 9999px;\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\\n  background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.4);\\n}\\n\\n/* Dynamic CSS Keyframes for standalone SVG/CSS interactive icon export */\\n@keyframes icon-pulse-ring {\\n  0% { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0.8; }\\n  50% { transform: scale(1.15); opacity: 0.3; }\\n  100% { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0.8; }\\n}\\n\\n@keyframes icon-float-bounce {\\n  0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px) rotate(0deg); }\\n  50% { transform: translateY(-7px) rotate(2deg); }\\n}\\n\\n@keyframes icon-spin-slow {\\n  from { transform: rotate(0deg); }\\n  to { transform: rotate(360deg); }\\n}\\n\\n@keyframes icon-spring-pop {\\n  0% { transform: scale(1); }\\n  40% { transform: scale(0.82); }\\n  75% { transform: scale(1.18); }\\n  100% { transform: scale(1); }\\n}\\n\\n@keyframes icon-draw-stroke {\\n  0% { stroke-dashoffset: 100; opacity: 0.2; }\\n  50% { stroke-dashoffset: 0; opacity: 1; }\\n  100% { stroke-dashoffset: 0; opacity: 1; }\\n}\\n\\n@keyframes icon-glitch-jitter {\\n  0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0); }\\n  20% { transform: translate(-2px, 1px); }\\n  40% { transform: translate(2px, -1px); }\\n  60% { transform: translate(-1px, -2px); }\\n  80% { transform: translate(1px, 2px); }\\n}\\n\\n@keyframes icon-heart-beat {\\n  0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }\\n  15% { transform: scale(1.28); }\\n  30% { transform: scale(0.95); }\\n  45% { transform: scale(1.18); }\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Configure fonts, base styles and SVG keyframe animations in src/index.css\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/index.css\",\"toolAction\":\"Updating index.css\",\"toolSummary\":\"Update global styles\"}"
