  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Icon Library**\n\nOkay, I\'m starting to build out the interactive icon definitions library in `src/data/iconsList.ts`. I\'m focusing on diverse categories to begin with, and I\'ve started the navigation category. I\'ve designed the first three icons, including `home`, `compass`, and `menu-morph`. The home icon will have a door and chimney path with chimney puff animation. The compass icon will have an oscillating dial with magnetic rotation.\n\n\n**Expanding Icon Categories**\n\nI\'ve been expanding the icon categories to include actions, interface elements, and commerce-related symbols. Specifically, I\'m now working on icons like a hamburger morphing into an \'X\', a bell with a notification badge, and a heart that bursts with confetti. There\'s also a clipboard, a sun/moon theme toggle, and a garbage can with a lid. Other actions include a padlock, a download cloud, and a refresh icon. I\'m focusing on interactive elements.\n\n\n**Adding New Icons**\n\nI\'m now focusing on commerce, media, tech, and social categories for icons. I\'m imagining interactive elements such as a cart with rolling wheels and a bouncing item package, a credit card with a magnetic chip and a 3D flip, and a tag with physical inertia. Media icons include a play/pause morph and dynamic expanding soundwaves. Tech and social icons will cover a range of options, including an AI magic sparkle and a globe rotating with a network.\n\n\n"
