    thinking: "**Constructing the Header**\n\nI\'m now diving into the implementation of `src/components/Header.tsx`, focusing on strict adherence to the Top Bar Contract. The goal is a concise header comprising a brand title, followed by four to five navigation links. It needs to be one clean line.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
