    }
    model_api_content_id: "e36d4ae8f23f45bb827da1d5bd8f74a5"
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "quiero que pienses y integreses para que mi cv sea mejor que el suyo y los proyectos demeustren todo lo que sabe el y mas\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nInstructions: If you need more context from the user you must first ask the user some questions using the ask_question tool. If you ask questions, you must wait for the user\'s answers. After the questions you must present a plan.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Generate video from text\"\nicon: \"video_spark\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add Veo 3 video generation to the app using the model veo-3.1-fast-generate-preview, the generated video must have an aspect ratio of `16:9` (landscape) or `9:16` (portrait)."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Add a Gemini chatbot\"\nicon: \"voice_chat\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add a multi-turn chat interface to the app using Gemini. The chat must maintain conversation history, display messages in a scrollable thread, and include a system instruction to give the chatbots specific roles. Use gemini-4-argon for particularly complex tasks, gemini-3.8-flash for general tasks, and gemini-3.1-flash-lite for tasks that should happen fast."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Add database and auth\"\nlogoUrl: \"https://www.gstatic.com/mobilesdk/250721_mobilesdk/mono_firebase_dark.svg\"\n---\n\nYou MUST connect the app to Firebase. Add functionality that uses Google Sign-in with Firebase Auth to securely identify users, and add data persistence to keep track of user data with Firestore."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Three.js 3D scenes\"\nicon: \"3d_rotation\"\n---\n\nI want to use Three.js in this app. You **MUST** use the `threejs` skill for this.\n\nFollow these 3D scene and procedural craft guidelines:\n- **Composite 3\342\200\22312 Part Procedural Models**: Never represent a hero subject, vehicle, tree, or structure with a single default primitive (`BoxGeometry`, `SphereGeometry`, etc.). Assemble subjects as a `THREE.Group` of 3\342\200\22312 distinct parts across primary silhouette, secondary details, and accents (using bevels, `LatheGeometry`, or `TubeGeometry`), vary `roughness`/`metalness` across adjacent parts, and pivot props at bottom-center flush with the ground plus soft radial contact shadows.\n- **Studio PBR Lighting, Surfaces & Atmosphere**: Enable `ACESFilmicToneMapping` and `RoomEnvironment` with `PMREMGenerator` for realistic metallic/roughness reflections. Pair a warm directional key light (with a tight shadow frustum) against a cool `HemisphereLight` fill, match `Fog` / `FogExp2` to the horizon/sky color, and use procedural `CanvasTexture` bump/roughness maps or custom shaders (never fetch external texture or `.hdr` URLs that can 404).\n- **Damped Camera & Lossless 60fps Loop**: Mount the WebGL `<canvas>` in a stable ref container outside re-rendering React UI, share geometries/materials (`InstancedMesh` for >20 repeated items, pre-allocated scratch `Vector3`/`Matrix4` objects in `requestAnimationFrame`), and smooth camera movement/OrbitControls with exponential damping (`1 - Math.exp(-k * dt)`).\n- **Viewport-First Controls**: Keep the 3D canvas full-bleed (`100vw x 100vh`) with a compact, collapsible floating control dock (`<= 15%` viewport footprint, using solid/`rgba` surfaces instead of `backdrop-filter` over WebGL)."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Generate music\"\nicon: \"music_note\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add music generation to the app using lyria-3-clip-preview for short clips (up to 30s) or lyria-3-pro-preview for full-length tracks."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      text: "quiero que pienses y integreses para que mi cv sea mejor que el suyo y los proyectos demeustren todo lo que sabe el y mas\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nInstructions: If you need more context from the user you must first ask the user some questions using the ask_question tool. If you ask questions, you must wait for the user\'s answers. After the questions you must present a plan.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    }
    media {
      mime_type: "image/png"
      blobref {
        blob_id: "/blobstore/prod/makersuite/spanner_managed/global::000054e2ea70026d:0000015f:2:000054e2ea70026d:0000000000000001::4e07c6c918ca020e:000001f8ad6018bc:00065e2ca1bd014f"
      }
      uri: "IMG_5547.png"
    }
  }
}
