  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing CV Optimization**\n\nI\'m focused on integrating elements to make the CV surpass the competitor\'s. My aim is to showcase all their expertise and then some, particularly through project demonstrations. I\'m actively considering how to highlight and present the user\'s achievements most effectively.\n\n\n**Initiating Information Gathering**\n\nI need to start by understanding the user\'s specific goals for their CV. I\'ll use the `ask_question` tool to gather key information. Once I have the answers, I\'ll formulate a plan to best present the user, considering the user is an expert. Given the attached image, I\'ll consider Juli\303\241n Nevado\'s CV as a relevant example to consider.\n\n\n**Refining Skill Extraction**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on extracting the core skills and features. I\'ve pinpointed specific examples: \"Generate video from text,\" \"Add a Gemini chatbot,\" and others, from the user\'s provided text blocks. I\'m focusing on their implied expertise in cloud services like Azure, and data technologies like Delta Lake and various database types. Furthermore, I\'ve noted the user\'s instructions to utilize the `ask_question` tool if further context is needed, and have verified this with the planning-mode skill.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_4333286"
      name: "view_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"AbsolutePath\":\"/skills/system_skills/planning_mode/SKILL.md\",\"toolAction\":\"Reading planning mode skill\",\"toolSummary\":\"View planning mode skill\"}"
