  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Planning Mode**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the planning mode instructions. I\'m clarifying the conditions that trigger it, like when the system requests a plan or design. I\'m paying close attention to the \"Interactive Clarification & Interview (Turn 1)\" phase, as this is the starting point. I\'m also ensuring I grasp the essence of how the system processes this design request.\n\n\n**Refining Question Formulation**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the specifics of the clarifying questions. I\'m ensuring they are concise, multiple-choice, and directly address underspecified requirements. I\'m particularly focused on the format of the questions for the `ask_question` tool, ensuring there\'s no markdown, and the options are clear and concise, with recommended choices. The goal is to make the tool easy to use.\n\n\n**Clarifying User Intent**\n\nI\'m now determining the user\'s requirements regarding the CV. I\'m focusing on the CV example of \"Juli\303\241n Nevado,\" a Software Engineer / Data Engineer. I need to understand what aspects the user wants to improve and integrate. The user provided a prompt listing projects related to Three.js, Gemini Chatbot, Veo 3, Lyria music generation, and Firebase. I must understand how these projects relate to the CV improvement.\n\n\n**Formulating CV Questions**\n\nI\'m now formulating the first multiple-choice question for the user. I\'m focusing on the CV\'s core identity: the name and professional profile. I\'ve framed the question directly, providing the user with concise options to choose from, like the user\'s name or a more generic Senior profile. This will help refine the CV creation process to the user\'s specific goals. I\'m focusing on a clean and clear presentation.\n\n\n**Crafting CV Enhancements**\n\nI\'m now generating the next multiple-choice questions for the user to refine the CV. I\'m focusing on visual and interactive elements, offering diverse options like a Three.js portfolio, a modern minimalist design, or an interactive data dashboard. I am then focusing on advanced interactive projects demonstrating the user\'s data and AI expertise, providing options such as a real-time big data pipeline, an ETL orchestrator, or a full data engineering suite. I want to build towards a CV that goes \"Engineer de elite\", and exceeds the previous one.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
